  "notes": "Revenue is from XBRL; Q4 values are FY minus 9M. Mostly subscription, with some usage-based products (Workers, R2). Non-GAAP gross margin is 73.1% (GAAP 71.8%). The GAAP operating loss of 29.6% in Q2'26 includes charges from the announced workforce reduction / 'agentic AI-first' restructuring; it was -13.1% a year earlier. TTM (Q3'25-Q2'26): OCF 633.4, capex 318.6 (PP&E 280.0 + capitalized software 38.6; network build-out), FCF 314.9 (12.5%) on revenue 2,512.4. Net cash = cash 1,663.8 + available-for-sale securities 2,499.0 - convertible notes carrying 3,270.3 (current 1,293.3 + non-current 1,977.0) at 6/30/26; operating leases excluded. NRR 120% is the dollar-based net retention for Q2'26 from the 10-Q. ttm_pe uses non-GAAP diluted EPS: 0.27+0.28+0.25+0.29=1.09 vs 0.20+0.19+0.16+0.21=0.76. Price $349.07 at the 2026-10-02 close. Theme: security / edge network; could also be filed as AI infrastructure.",
